        "disenchant-thing :parameters (?caster - character ?thing - item ?target - (either character item) ?location - location) :precondition (and (at ?caster ?location) (at ?thing ?location) (not (asleep ?caster)) (has ?caster ?target) (enchanted ?thing)) :effect (not (enchanted ?thing)))": "(:action disenchant-thing :parameters (?caster - character ?thing - item ?target - (either character item) ?location - location) :precondition (and (at ?caster ?location) (at ?thing ?location) (not (asleep ?caster)) (has ?caster ?target) (enchanted ?thing)) :effect (not (enchanted ?thing)))",
